  ENG --> M3[Crop engine L1 / DSSAT L3 adapter]
  ENG --> M4[PV + agrivoltaic ground radiation]
  ENG --> M5[Finance]
  TL --> OPT[Uncertainty + MILP CVaR + VOI]
  TL --> CAL[Calibration + promotion gate]
  ENG --> DB[(PostGIS)]
  PROV[Weather/Soil/Market/Satellite providers] --> DB
